# Cursor Rules & Behavior

## 1. Context Awareness
ALWAYS read `CURSOR_CONTEXT.md` at the start of a session logic check. It contains the Single Source of Truth for system configuration.

## 2. Ignored Files
NEVER read or index files ending in `.bak`. These are deprecated legacy scripts.
Specifically ignore `server/scripts/seed-llm-config.js.bak` and `server/scripts/seed_llm.js.bak`.

## 3. LLM Configuration
When asked about API Keys or AI Models:
- The database (`llm_providers` table) is the runtime authority.
- `scripts/seed_llm_providers.cjs` is the configuration authority.
- `.env` is the secret storage.

## 4. Verification
Before declaring a system "broken", run:
`node scripts/validate_llm_keys.cjs`
This script performs a full system integration test (API connection + DB check + Audit Log check).
